  [3mComplexity:[0m trivial.

  [1mB. Injectable-storage factory with a default instance[0m — the module exports [38;5;153mcreateVisitorIdStore(storage)[39m plus a
  default [38;5;153mgetVisitorId()[39m already bound to [38;5;153mwindow.localStorage[39m. Call sites look identical to A; tests build a store over
  an in-memory fake.
  [3mBuys:[0m the failure modes that actually matter here — storage throwing in private mode, a corrupt or empty stored value,
  quota errors — become ordinary unit tests with no global patching. Same ergonomics as A for consumers.
  [3mCosts:[0m about fifteen extra lines and two exported names instead of one.
  [3mComplexity:[0m trivial-to-moderate.

  [1mC. Explicit bootstrap at app start[0m — [38;5;153minitVisitorId()[39m runs once in the entry script; the ID is then passed down as an
