  [3mBuys:[0m fully explicit data flow, no hidden module state, trivially testable because it's a pure value.
  [3mCosts:[0m every future form must be reached by the bootstrap and must thread the value through its call chain — the thing
  that gets tedious exactly as "other forms will need it later" comes true. Also breaks if a page has a different entry
  point.
  [3mComplexity:[0m moderate.

